## Verdict

Ready to merge, Needs your decision or Do not merge, with the risk: green, yellow or red.

## Unresolved

What this PR couldn't verify, the assumptions it makes, and anything to check yourself.

## Links

The work order, the planning PR it is part of, related PRs and issues.

## Asked and built

What was asked, what was built, the diff's size and how to roll it back.

## Evidence

Each check run on the head commit: the command and its result.

## Review rounds

Each review finding: fixed (with the commit), declined (with why) or deferred.

## Cost and turns

One line: what the work cost, in money and agent turns, if an agent did it.

## The worker's account

If an agent did the work: its choices, the alternatives, why, and the impact. It is a claim, not evidence.
